# Task 149-006: `.deck` Config Interpolation

## Plan
1. Create `src/core/deck-interpolation.ts` — interpolateConfig function using loadDeckSecrets
2. Patch `src/core/config.ts` — call interpolateConfig on resolved config before caching
3. Create `tests/core/deck-interpolation.test.ts` — 6 tests

## Approach
- Pattern: `$DECK:KEY_NAME` (exact match, full string only)
- Deep interpolation: recurse objects and arrays
- Fallback: try `DECKENT_` prefix variant
- Missing key: warn + keep placeholder (no crash)
- Integration point: after resolved object is built, before cache update (line ~816)
